  <item>
    <title>8 我发疯了，爽了，也伤了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6578851320d779b49d5e11f7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6578851320d779b49d5e11f7</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 13 Dec 2023 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们来聊聊发疯～</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一期搞笑心酸却解压、反内耗的节目，一起来听听吉思和毛毛的发疯经历吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>想聊这个话题起因是近期经常感觉整个人就像应激后张牙舞抓的小猫，对一切“不可理喻”的人或事都会立刻炸起寒毛，喵喵大叫。</span></p><span></span><p><span>可发疯似乎也有代价，我们会因为发疯后晦气扫光光而舒畅无比，但也会因为发疯而内疚甚至是痛苦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望这期播客可以给你带来对于发疯的新理解和新体验，赶紧来听吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>更多精彩可见timeline～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="71">01:11</a> 骑车被bie泪失禁体质大爆发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="467">07:47</a> 手机屏碎索赔大发疯事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a> 英国街头遇狡猾种族歧视，大声狂背骂人语录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1535">25:35</a> 我把茶水泼向父亲的脸，家庭聚餐大失控</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2348">39:08</a> 职场语言性骚扰如何反击？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lj8K4i8ITHYp2HXm0udCrj6vfjkP.m4a" length="68916589" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:47:29</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZvV21kWjNva2pEZHJuTFhnN3VCb3BGMzh0eWkucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
